  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 establishes the window editing and composition contract for Icod.DCurses: non-standard window repositioning, local cell and region editing, Unicode-safe cell and line insertion/deletion, deterministic copy/overlay, geometric line and border drawing, and safe range touch/query operations. Public untouch remains deliberately omitted to preserve refresh correctness. Dependencies remain Icod.Terminal 1.0.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
